{"seq":2,"slug":"composition-tools","title":"构图工具（景深/视场）：把游戏相机当一台真镜头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/tools/composition-tools","wordCount":1584,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"构图工具-景深-视场-把游戏相机当一台真镜头\">构图工具（景深/视场）：把游戏相机当一台真镜头</h1><p>一张让人多看两眼的游戏照片，往往赢在光学而非调色：主体清晰、背景奶油般虚化，或是一个夸张的广角把渺小的角色抛进宏大的天地。这些效果不是滤镜（那是 <a href=\"post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a> 的颜色范畴），而是对一台真实相机镜头成像行为的模拟——景深、焦距、光圈、视场。这一篇讲清楚拍照模式如何把冷冰冰的投影矩阵包装成玩家能理解的「对焦」「光圈」「广角/长焦」，以及背后那点必须懂一些的光学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从投影矩阵到镜头语言\">核心概念：从投影矩阵到镜头语言</h2><p>游玩时，相机的视场角（FOV）是一个为操作性和防眩晕定死的值，见 <a href=\"free-camera\">自由相机控制</a> 里对相机参数的讨论。拍照时，FOV、对焦、光圈都变成玩家可创作的维度。要把它们暴露好，得先理解这几个参数在成像上如何协同：视场决定「装下多少」，对焦决定「哪儿清晰」，光圈决定「虚化多强」。下图梳理构图工具如何作用于成像：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[相机位姿&lt;br/&gt;来自自由相机] --&gt; B[视场角 FOV&lt;br/&gt;焦距]&#10;  B --&gt; C[投影矩阵]&#10;  A --&gt; D[对焦距离]&#10;  D --&gt; E[景深 DOF]&#10;  F[光圈 f-stop] --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; G[清晰基准图像]&#10;  E --&gt; H[按弥散圆模糊]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[叠加构图辅助线&lt;br/&gt;三分/中心/水平仪]&#10;  I --&gt; J[最终取景画面]\">flowchart TD\n  A[相机位姿&lt;br/&gt;来自自由相机] --&gt; B[视场角 FOV&lt;br/&gt;焦距]\n  B --&gt; C[投影矩阵]\n  A --&gt; D[对焦距离]\n  D --&gt; E[景深 DOF]\n  F[光圈 f-stop] --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; G[清晰基准图像]\n  E --&gt; H[按弥散圆模糊]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[叠加构图辅助线&lt;br/&gt;三分/中心/水平仪]\n  I --&gt; J[最终取景画面]</pre><p>视场与焦距是同一件事的两种说法，它们决定投影矩阵；对焦距离与光圈共同决定景深；最后叠一层构图辅助线帮玩家摆位。三者相对独立，可分别做深。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视场与焦距-广角的张力与长焦的压缩\">视场与焦距：广角的张力与长焦的压缩</h2><p>视场角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 与焦距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、传感器尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 2\\arctan\\!\\left(\\frac{d}{2f}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>焦距越短，视场越广，透视越夸张——近大远小被放大，主体被推离背景，产生「渺小个体对壮阔天地」的张力，适合风景大场面。焦距越长，视场越窄，透视被压缩——远近物体的大小差被拉平，背景被「拉近压扁」，适合人像特写和把远山「贴」到角色身后的压缩构图。给玩家的暴露方式通常有两种：直接给 FOV 滑杆（工程师友好），或给「焦距 mm」刻度（摄影玩家友好，更有代入感）。成熟的拍照模式倾向后者，因为它借用了真实摄影的语汇。</p>\n<p>要注意广角的代价：极端广角会在画面边缘产生明显畸变，把边缘的角色脸拉变形。可提供一个可选的畸变校正，或干脆限制 FOV 上限，避免玩家拍出「大头怪」还不知道为什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"景深-弥散圆与光圈的虚化物理\">景深：弥散圆与光圈的虚化物理</h2><p>景深（Depth of Field, DOF）是拍照模式里技术含量最高的构图工具。它模拟真实镜头「只有对焦平面上的物体绝对清晰，前后逐渐模糊」的物理。模糊的程度用<strong>弥散圆</strong>（Circle of Confusion, CoC）描述：一个点光源经过失焦成像后，在传感器上摊成的一个圆斑，圆越大越模糊。对于对焦距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、某物体距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、焦距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、光圈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，弥散圆直径可近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\frac{f^2}{N}\\cdot\\frac{|d - s|}{d\\,(s - f)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子告诉玩家两个可操作的旋钮：<strong>对焦距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（对到谁身上，谁最清晰）和<strong>光圈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 越小即光圈越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 越大即虚化越强）。渲染实现上，游戏 DOF 通常不做真实光线追踪，而是按每像素深度算出 CoC 半径，再用分层散景（bokeh）模糊近似——这属于图形管线，见 <a href=\"../game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline\">后处理管线</a> 的散景实现，本篇只关心把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 暴露给玩家。</p>\n<p>对焦的交互设计很关键。三种常见方式各有取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对焦方式</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动对焦主体</td>\n<td>一键对到角色</td>\n<td>零门槛，快</td>\n<td>无法对背景/前景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击/准星对焦</td>\n<td>指哪对哪</td>\n<td>直觉、精确</td>\n<td>需额外交互控件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动对焦距离</td>\n<td>滑杆拉焦平面</td>\n<td>可拉焦、可创作</td>\n<td>抽象，新手难懂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>好的实现会同时提供「一键对主体」兜底和「手动拉焦」进阶，兼顾新手与高玩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"构图辅助-三分线-水平仪与宽高比\">构图辅助：三分线、水平仪与宽高比</h2><p>光学之外，摆位辅助是构图工具的另一半。它们不改变画面像素，只叠加一层引导玩家「怎么放」的可视辅助：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>构图网格</strong>：三分线、黄金螺旋、中心十字。帮玩家把主体放在视觉舒适的位置，是虚拟摄影社群公认的入门利器。</li>\n<li><strong>水平仪</strong>：一条指示相机 roll 是否水平的横线。承接 <a href=\"free-camera\">自由相机控制</a> 里可开放的翻滚（roll），玩家有意打荷兰角时它提示倾斜角度，无意歪了时它帮忙回正。</li>\n<li><strong>宽高比与安全框</strong>：切换 16:9、21:9 电影宽幅、1:1 方图、9:16 竖屏（适配手机分享）。改变宽高比会改变构图的呼吸感，宽幅天然电影味，竖屏天然社交味。宽高比还直接影响捕获时的裁剪，与 <a href=\"../practice/capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a> 的输出尺寸联动。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些辅助线只在取景时显示，捕获成片时必须隐藏——否则玩家会拍下带网格的废片，这是个反复出现的低级 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>构图工具模拟真实镜头的光学与几何（视场、对焦、光圈、宽高比），与处理颜色的滤镜分工明确。</li>\n<li>视场/焦距决定透视：广角制造张力但边缘畸变，长焦压缩空间适合人像，暴露方式宜用「焦距 mm」贴近摄影语汇。</li>\n<li>景深靠弥散圆模拟，玩家的两个旋钮是对焦距离与光圈；对焦交互应兼顾「一键对主体」与「手动拉焦」。</li>\n<li>构图辅助（三分线、水平仪、宽高比）只叠加引导、不改像素，且捕获成片时必须隐藏。</li>\n<li>宽高比既是构图语言也影响输出尺寸，与高分辨率捕获直接联动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a>（颜色，与光学分工）、<a href=\"../camera/free-camera\">自由相机控制</a>（FOV 与 roll 是相机参数）、<a href=\"character-posing\">角色与表情控制</a>（对焦的主体）、<a href=\"../practice/capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a>（宽高比决定输出尺寸）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：景深散景的渲染实现，见图形 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline\">后处理管线</a>；游玩时相机取景构图的自动化（与拍照手动相反），见相机系统 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-camera-systems/framing-control/framing-composition\">取景与构图</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构图工具（景深/视场）：把游戏相机当一台真镜头","id":"构图工具-景深-视场-把游戏相机当一台真镜头"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从投影矩阵到镜头语言","id":"核心概念-从投影矩阵到镜头语言"},{"level":2,"text":"视场与焦距：广角的张力与长焦的压缩","id":"视场与焦距-广角的张力与长焦的压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"景深：弥散圆与光圈的虚化物理","id":"景深-弥散圆与光圈的虚化物理"},{"level":2,"text":"构图辅助：三分线、水平仪与宽高比","id":"构图辅助-三分线-水平仪与宽高比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"后处理与滤镜：把调色台交到玩家手里","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/tools/post-processing-filters"},"next":{"title":"角色与表情控制：让照片里的人活过来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/tools/character-posing"}}